# PDF commerce & storefront UI

## Design system

- Component catalog and tokens: [`docs/STYLEGUIDE.md`](../../docs/STYLEGUIDE.md) (DS 2.0.0).
- Prefixes: `.pdf-*`, `.ops-*`, `.buyer-faq*`, `.success-page*`.

## Mobile (required before merge)

New `.pdf-*` or `.ops-*` block **must** include `@media (max-width: 480px)` rules:

- No horizontal overflow on section/card
- Touch targets ≥ 44px
- Preview dialog: `100dvh`, scroll-snap for sample pages where applicable

Regression: [`tests/e2e/mobile-pdf-commerce.spec.js`](../../tests/e2e/mobile-pdf-commerce.spec.js) at 320 / 375 px.

## SOT & hydration

Edit copy in [`config/sot.json`](../../config/sot.json):

- `#commerce` — Stripe links, pricing, compare strip, delivery promise, testimonials
- `#pdfGuides` — chapter lists (TOC accordions)
- `#buyerFaq` — buyer FAQ + JSON-LD mirror

`generator.js`: `initCommerce()`, `initLegal()`, `initPdfGuideTocs()`, `initBuyerFaq()`, `initPdfPreviewDialog()`.

## Bootstrap invariant (do not break)

On `DOMContentLoaded`:

1. `initCommerce(DEFAULT_SOT)` and `initLegal(DEFAULT_SOT)` **synchronously** (before SOT fetch completes).
2. After `loadSotConfig()`: re-run `initCommerce(config)` **before** `initializeApp()`.
3. `index.html` PDF CTAs must keep static `https://buy.stripe.com/...` `href` fallbacks (checkout works without JS).

## Copy safety (enforced by `tests/structure.test.js`)

- `commerce.deliveryPromise` — no `under 60 seconds`
- `commerce.compareStrip.pdValue` — no unsourced `~ $NN` exact PD price
- Follow [`docs/marketing_plan.md`](../../docs/marketing_plan.md) §4–5, §11

## Publish gate

When `commerce.allowPlaceholderCheckout === false`, `npm test` requires live `https://buy.stripe.com/` URLs with no `YOUR_` placeholders.

## Tests

| Change | Command |
|--------|---------|
| UX / interactions | `npm run test:smoke`, `npm run test:a11y` |
| PDF layout / CSS | `npm run test:e2e` |
| SOT commerce only | `npm test` (+ smoke for Stripe href poll) |

`success.html` is included in a11y (`/success?session_id=cs_test_...`).
